# Build context hygiene for workers/runpod-blender/Dockerfile (built from repo
# root). Keep the context small and NEVER ship secrets or large local data into
# the image. The Dockerfile only needs workers/runpod-blender/{package.json,
# package-lock.json,src} and scripts/blender.

# --- Secrets: never copy into the build context / image ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/secrets
**/*secret*.json
scripts/ddp_github_push.local.sh
**/ddp_github_push.local.sh

# --- Dependencies / build output (reinstalled inside the image) ---
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.vercel
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Large local-only data not needed by the worker image ---
assets/
artifacts/
production-library/
**/.doodle-dash-storage
**/test-results

# --- VCS / editor / logs ---
.git
.gitignore
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
